{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"_content_ AdAsia\">\n<p class=\"_page_ _page_1 read-full\">\n以正宗手工葡撻享譽全球的葡萄牙里斯本烘焙名店 SANTA NATA正式登陸中環！店家在英國倫敦設有多間分店，是當地的排隊名店，香港店將沿用超過300年葡萄牙修道院傳統秘方製作葡撻，香港人有口福了！\n</p>\n<div class=\"_more_content_\">\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_2\">\n<h2>葡萄牙葡撻名店 SANTA NATA登港！</h2>\n<p>手工葡撻經多次摺疊壓製而成，其最大賣點是撻皮酥脆，層次分明，入口有明顯牛油香；幼滑的吉士內餡，甜度控制得平衡，亦不會太甜，加埋焦糖炙燒表面，預計又是另一間爆紅葡式蛋撻店！</p>\n<blockquote></blockquote>\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_3\">\n<img alt=\"葡撻 (圖片來源：官方圖片)\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178219453513391173_15288244996a3a21675a91b.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">(圖片來源：官方圖片)\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_4\">\n<img alt=\"葡撻 (圖片來源：官方圖片)\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178219453709289958_5808411696a3a216942f2e.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">(圖片來源：官方圖片)\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_5\">\n<img alt=\"葡撻 (圖片來源：官方圖片)\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178219453919572270_11286168666a3a216b75614.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">(圖片來源：官方圖片)\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_6\">\n<img alt=\"葡撻 (圖片來源：官方圖片)\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178219454155064579_4026657356a3a216dbd09c.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">(圖片來源：官方圖片)\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_7\">\n<img alt=\"葡撻 (圖片來源：官方圖片)\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/17821945433119140_19634901736a3a216f80ef4.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">(圖片來源：官方圖片)\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_8\">\n<img alt=\"葡撻 (圖片來源：官方圖片)\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178219454470953785_11544640056a3a2170d83b1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">(圖片來源：官方圖片)\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_9\">\n<div class=\"business_info_div\"><p class=\"business_info_name\">名稱：SANTA NATA</p><p class=\"business_info_address\">地址：中環擺花街25-27號</p></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"_page_ _page_10\">\n</p>\n<div class=\"qa_box\" onclick=\"toggleFAQ(this)\">\n<p class=\"question\">香港18區美食有甚麼推介？</p>\n<p class=\"answer\">新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等……即睇更多詳情。<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T07:40:03.486152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}